# Civic integration docs

- Evergreen SoT + index: [`docs/integration/civic.md`](docs/integration/civic.md)
- Open work: [`docs/integration/civic_tasks/active/`](docs/integration/civic_tasks/active/)
- New tasks: copy [`docs/integration/civic_tasks/_template.md`](docs/integration/civic_tasks/_template.md) → `active/<slug>.md`, then add a row to the Task directory in `civic.md`
- Do **not** append new `## Next work` sections to `civic.md`
- When done: set `status: done`, move file to `civic_tasks/done/`, update the Task directory
- Target **`/var/www/rovdev`** (`dev.rovas.app`) unless the user asks for prod
- Human deploys (see always-apply deploy-owner rule); leave code + docs ready
- Do not treat Agent Stores or chat history as the contract SoT
